msgstr "Congrats! You've been promoted to %(career)s."

#: apps/interviews/views.py:362
msgid ""
"Você passou no teste. Continue praticando ou avance para o próximo nível."
msgstr "You passed the test. Keep practicing or move on to the next level."

#: apps/interviews/views.py:419
msgid "Tentativa descartada."
